# Silead touch calibration [V] 2026-10-26. Taps at the screen's top-left, top-right and
# bottom-left read (2%, 97%), (98%, 96%), (2%, 4%) on the device: the chip reports in the
# landscape picture's own axes, y upward. cog (patches/cog/0002) then turns each point as if it
# came from the portrait panel: at rotation=3, page = (py, 1 - px). Swapping x and y here makes
# that page = (device x, 1 - device y), the point under the finger.
ACTION=="add|change", SUBSYSTEM=="input", ATTRS{name}=="silead_ts", ENV{LIBINPUT_CALIBRATION_MATRIX}="0 1 0 1 0 0"
